<title>USA: FGIC qualifies two bond issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies two bond issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>FGIC said it qualified for insurance two bond issues slated for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Almont Community Schools, Mich., $12.1 million general obligation bond issue.</p>
<p>--Texarkana, Texas, $2.8 million water and sewer revenue bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
